<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 83.34 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday and Friday last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Jan 3   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		1,447.38	  1,447.38</p>
<p>    - sales		    1,530.72	  1,530.72</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  (83.34)	   (83.34)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
